---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Welcome">
  <div class="text-center py-12">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">
      A Guided Path Forward
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      Navigating a pediatric oncology diagnosis can be overwhelming. We provide a step-by-step roadmap specifically tailored for families in the Canadian healthcare system, with deep-dives into rare tumors and direct links to premier hospital resources.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-10 flex justify-center gap-4">
      <a href="/journey" class="rounded-md bg-sky-600 px-6 py-3 text-lg font-semibold text-white shadow-sm hover:bg-sky-500 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-sky-600 no-underline">
        Start The Journey
      </a>
      <a href="/tumors" class="rounded-md bg-white px-6 py-3 text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-inset ring-gray-300 hover:bg-gray-50 no-underline">
        Explore Rare Tumors
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
